msgstr "Ne prikazuj povezave za urejanje v namigih v teh vsebnikih"

msgid ""
"Tips show copies of the \"Edit\" and \"Layout\" links for nodes, users and "
"taxonomy terms. These links are not helpful on lists of content from remote "
"nodes.<br>Provide a comma-separated list of page sections of where these "
"links should not show, E.g.: <code><em>#sidebar-menu, .news-feed</em></code>."
"<br>To hide the links <strong>everywhere</strong>, set this field to an "
"asterisk (<code><em>*</em></code>).<br>To modify the links, <a "
"href=\"https://editoria11y.princeton.edu/configuration/#modify-tips\" "
"target=\"_blank\">use the ed11yPop event</a> in your theme JS."
msgstr ""
"Namigi prikazujejo kopije povezav »Uredi« in »Postavitev« za vozlišča, "
"uporabnike in taksonomske izraze. Te povezave niso koristne na seznamih "
"vsebine iz oddaljenih vozlišč.<br>Navedite seznam delov strani, ločenih z "
"vejico, kjer te povezave ne smejo biti prikazane, npr.: <code><em>#sidebar-"
"menu, .news-feed</em></code>.<br>Za skrivanje povezav <strong>povsod</"
"strong> nastavite to polje na zvezdico (<code><em>*</em></code>).<br>Za "
"spremembo povezav <a href=\"https://editoria11y.princeton.edu/configuration/"
"#modify-tips\" target=\"_blank\">uporabite dogodek ed11yPop</a> v JS vaše "
"teme."

