msgstr ""
"JS teme bo poskrbel za razkrivanje skritih namigov znotraj teh vsebnikov"

msgid ""
"Editoria11y detects hidden tooltips and warns the user when they try to jump "
"to them from the panel. For elements on this list, Editoria11y will <a "
"href=\"https://itmaybejj.github.io/editoria11y/#dealing-with-alerts-on-"
"hidden-or-size-constrained-content\">dispatch a JS event</a> instead of a "
"warning, so custom JS in your theme can first reveal the hidden tip (e.g., "
"open an accordion or tab panel)."
msgstr ""
"Editoria11y zaznava skrite namige in opozori uporabnika, ko skuša nanje "
"skočiti s plošče. Za elemente na tem seznamu bo Editoria11y <a "
"href=\"https://itmaybejj.github.io/editoria11y/#dealing-with-alerts-on-"
"hidden-or-size-constrained-content\">razposlal JS dogodek</a> namesto "
"opozorila, tako da prilagojeni JS vaše teme najprej razkrije skrit namig "
"(npr. odpre harmoniko ali tabelo)."

msgid "Detecting dynamic and shadow content"
msgstr "Zaznavanje dinamične in shadow DOM vsebine"

msgid "Dynamically refresh if new content appears"
msgstr "Dinamično osveži, če se pojavi nova vsebina"

msgid "Watch for changes anywhere on the page"
msgstr "Opazuj spremembe kjerkoli na strani"

msgid "Only watch for changes to content containers present on load"
msgstr "Opazuj samo spremembe vsebinskih vsebnikov, prisotnih ob nalaganju"

msgid "Do not watch for changes"
msgstr "Ne opazuj sprememb"

msgid ""
"Set to \"anywhere\" if changes are being missed, set to \"ignore\" if you "
"notice performance issues. Themes and modules can also call "
"<code>Drupal.Ed11y.refresh()</code> to refresh results."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite na »kjerkoli«, če zamujate spremembe, nastavite na »prezri«, če "
"opazite težave z zmogljivostjo. Teme in moduli lahko prav tako pokličejo "
"<code>Drupal.Ed11y.refresh()</code> za osvežitev rezultatov."

msgid "Check inside these specific Web components"
msgstr "Preveri znotraj teh specifičnih spletnih komponent"

msgid ""
"Provide selectors for elements with <a href='https://developer.mozilla.org/"
"en-US/docs/Web/Web_Components'>shadow DOM</a> you want tested. E.g.: "
"<code><em>my-fancy-accordion-widget, my-magical-slideshow</em></code>."
msgstr ""
"Navedite selektorje za elemente s <a href='https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/Web_Components'>shadow DOM</a>, ki jih želite testirati. Npr.: "
"<code><em>my-fancy-accordion-widget, my-magical-slideshow</em></code>."

msgid "Auto-detect any Web components"
msgstr "Samodejno zaznaj kakršnekoli spletne komponente"

msgid ""
"This is easier to configure than specifying components, but may slow test "
"runs on very complicated pages."
msgstr ""
"To je lažje konfigurirati kakor navajanje komponent, a lahko upočasni "
"izvajanje testov na zelo zapletenih straneh."

msgid "Syncing results to reports"
msgstr "Sinhronizacija rezultatov v poročila"

msgid ""
"Remember that results only sync to the dashboard when viewing nodes. Results "
"shown while editing or viewing previews or revisions will not sync."
msgstr ""
"Upoštevajte, da se rezultati sinhronizirajo z nadzorno ploščo samo pri "
"ogledu vozlišč. Rezultati, prikazani med urejanjem ali ogledom predogledov "
"ali revizij, se ne bodo sinhronizirali."

msgid "Remove redundant base url from URLs"
msgstr "Odstrani odvečni osnovni URL iz URL naslovov"

msgid ""
"Provide base URL (\"/mysite\") if your site is installed in a subdirectory. "
"Subdirectories tend to get duplicated (/mysite/mysite/mypage) and throw "
"errors from the API."
msgstr ""
"Navedite osnovni URL (\"/mysite\"), če je vaše spletišče nameščeno v "
"podimenik. Podimeniki se nagibajo k podvajanju (/mysite/mysite/mypage) in "
"povzročajo napake iz API."

msgid "Preserve query parameters"
msgstr "Ohrani parametre poizvedbe"

msgid ""
"The dashboard ignores most parameters: results for both /news?f=1 and /news?"
"f=2 will show up as just /news. Provide a comma separated list of parameters "
"that are meaningful, and should appear as separate pages in results."
msgstr ""
"Nadzorna plošča prezre večino parametrov: rezultati za /news?f=1 in /news?"
"f=2 se bodo prikazali samo kot /news. Navedite seznam parametrov, ločenih z "
"vejico, ki so smiselni in naj se prikazujejo kot ločene strani v rezultatih."

msgid "Disable sync altogether"
msgstr "V celoti onemogoči sinhronizacijo"

msgid ""
"Syncing test results back to Drupal is required for the <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"/admin/reports/editoria11y\">issue</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"/admin/reports/editoria11y/dismissals\">dismissal</a> dashboards and "
"\"mark OK\" buttons."
msgstr ""
"Sinhronizacija rezultatov testov nazaj v Drupal je potrebna za nadzorni "
"plošči <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/admin/reports/editoria11y\">težav</a> in "
"<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/admin/reports/editoria11y/"
"dismissals\">zavrnitev</a> ter gumbe »označi kot V redu«."

msgid "Heading outline position of editable content"
msgstr "Položaj obrisa naslovov urejljive vsebine"

msgid ""
"To check headings in CKEditor, Editoria11y needs to know what the first "
"heading level should be in this field. Body fields should generally be at "
"the h2 level."
msgstr ""
"Za preverjanje naslovov v CKEditor mora Editoria11y vedeti, katera je prva "
"raven naslova v tem polju. Polja telesa so navadno na ravni h2."

msgid "H2 level fields (body content)"
msgstr "Polja ravni h2 (vsebina telesa)"

msgid ""
"Body fields on nodes are preceded by an h1, and their heading outline should "
"start with an h2. Ideally set this for top-level body fields for each of "
"your content types, and set blocks and embedded nodes to h3 or h4.\n"
"        <br>Set all content types: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-body-"
"wrapper .ck-content</em></code>\n"
"        <br>Set specific content types: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-"
"body-wrapper .ck-content</em></code>\n"
"        <br>Set up for Gutenberg: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-body-"
"wrapper .is-root-container</em></code>"
msgstr ""
"Poljem telesa na vozliščih predhodi h1, in njihov obris naslovov naj se "
"začne z h2. V idealnem primeru to nastavite za polja telesa na najvišji "
"ravni za vsako vrsto vsebine, bloke in vdelana vozlišča pa nastavite na h3 "
"ali h4.\n"
"        <br>Nastavi vse vrste vsebine: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-"
"body-wrapper .ck-content</em></code>\n"
"        <br>Nastavi določene vrste vsebine: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] "
"#edit-body-wrapper .ck-content</em></code>\n"
"        <br>Nastavi za Gutenberg: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-body-"
"wrapper .is-root-container</em></code>"

msgid "H3 level fields (blocks or paragraphs with separate titles)"
msgstr "Polja ravni h3 (bloki ali odstavki z ločenimi naslovi)"

msgid ""
"Sometimes inline and layout builder blocks are grouped under an h2 from a "
"separate field, so their highest heading level should be h3."
msgstr ""
"Včasih so bloki vgrajenih in graditeljev postavitve združeni pod h2 iz "
"ločenega polja, zato naj bo njihova najvišja raven naslova h3."

msgid "H4 level fields (deeply nested blocks or paragraphs)"
msgstr "Polja ravni h4 (globoko gnezdeni bloki ali odstavki)"

msgid ""
"Sometimes inline and layout builder blocks are grouped under an h3 from a "
"separate field, so their highest heading level should be h4."
msgstr ""
"Včasih so bloki vgrajenih in graditeljev postavitve združeni pod h3 iz "
"ločenega polja, zato naj bo njihova najvišja raven naslova h4."

msgid "Modify tests that usually detect content issues"
msgstr "Spremeni teste, ki navadno zaznajo vsebinske težave"

msgid "Modify tests that usually detect template or configuration issues"
msgstr ""
"Spremeni teste, ki navadno zaznajo težave s predlogami ali konfiguracijo"

msgid "Do not check contrast for these elements"
msgstr "Ne preverjaj kontrasta za te elemente"

msgid ""
"Provide a comma-separated list of selectors for elements to ignore for all "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Navedite seznam selektorjev, ločenih z vejico, za elemente, ki se prezrejo "
"za vse uporabnike."

msgid "Remind editor that content in these embeds needs manual review"
msgstr "Opomni urednika, da vsebina v teh vdelavah zahteva ročni pregled"

msgid ""
"Provide a comma-separated list of selectors you wish to flag for the editor, "
"e.g.: <code><em>.my-embedded-feed, #my-social-link-block</em></code>."
msgstr ""
"Navedite seznam selektorjev, ločenih z vejico, ki jih želite označiti za "
"urednika, npr.: <code><em>.my-embedded-feed, #my-social-link-block</em></"
"code>."

msgid ""
"Default settings should work with both <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/"
"project/linkpurpose\" target=\"_blank\">Link Purpose Icons</a> and <a "
"target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/extlink\">External "
"Links</a>."
msgstr ""
"Privzete nastavitve delujejo z <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/"
"linkpurpose\" target=\"_blank\">Link Purpose Icons</a> in <a "
"target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/extlink\">External "
"Links</a>."

msgid "Remind the editor that these linked documents need a manual check"
msgstr "Opomni urednika, da ti povezani dokumenti zahtevajo ročno preveritev"

msgid ""
"Add or remove filetypes. Set to \"false\" to disable the test altogether. "
"Providing any value will override the default, which is "
"<code><em>a[href$='.pdf'], a[href*='.pdf?']</em></code>."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte ali odstranite vrste datotek. Nastavite na \"false\", da v celoti "
"onemogočite test. Vsaka vrednost bo prepisala privzeto: "
"<code><em>a[href$='.pdf'], a[href*='.pdf?']</em></code>."

msgid "Remove elements that match these selectors before testing link text"
msgstr ""
"Odstrani elemente, ki ustrezajo tem selektorjem, pred testiranjem besedila "
"povezave"

msgid ""
"Provide a CSS selector of elements your modules programmatically add to "
"links (usually external or open-in-new-window links), so they can be ignored "
"when the link text is checked for the \"link has no text\" and \"link text "
"is not meaningful\" tests.<br>E.g.: <code><em>.this, .that</em></code>"
msgstr ""
"Navedite CSS selektor elementov, ki jih vaši moduli programsko dodajajo k "
"povezavam (navadno zunanje ali povezave za odpiranje v novem oknu), da se "
"prezrejo pri preverjanju besedila za testa »povezava nima besedila« in "
"»besedilo povezave ni smiselno«.<br>Npr.: <code><em>.this, .that</em></code>"

msgid "Remove these strings before testing link text"
msgstr "Odstrani te nize pred testiranjem besedila povezave"

msgid ""
"Provide a pipe-separated (\"|\") list of phrases your modules "
"programmatically add to links to hint a purpose (external, mail, phone, open-"
"in-new-window), so they can be ignored when the link text is checked for the "
"\"link has no text\" and \"link text is not meaningful\" tests; e.g.:  "
"<pre><code><em>(link is external)|(link sends email)</em></code></pre>"
msgstr ""
"Navedite seznam fraz, ločenih z \"|\", ki jih vaši moduli programsko "
"dodajajo k povezavam za nakazovanje namena (zunanja, pošta, telefon, "
"odpiranje v novem oknu), da se prezrejo pri preverjanju besedila za testa "
"»povezava nima besedila« in »besedilo povezave ni smiselno«; npr.:  "
"<pre><code><em>(link is external)|(link sends email)</em></code></pre>"

msgid "Strings in links that indicate new tabs"
msgstr "Nizi v povezavah, ki nakazujejo nove zavihke"

msgid ""
"Provide a pipe-separated list of phrases your site uses to warn users a link "
"opens in a new tab; e.g.:  <pre><code><em>new&nbsp;tab|new&nbsp;window|"
"external</em></code></pre>"
msgstr ""
"Navedite seznam fraz, ločenih z \"|\", ki jih vaše spletišče uporablja za "
"opozarjanje uporabnikov, da se povezava odpre v novem zavihku; npr.:  "
"<pre><code><em>new&nbsp;tab|new&nbsp;window|external</em></code></pre>"

msgid ""
"Modules like Link Purpose or External Links can mark links automatically."
msgstr ""
"Moduli, kot sta Link Purpose ali External Links, lahko samodejno označijo "
"povezave."

